      "v": "anya",
      "t": "И что?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what?' Vika starts with 'what' and pairs it with 'what' to make the point clear. Then Max replies.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "leva",
      "t": "Я не хочу свободные отношения.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I do not want an open relationship.' The key word here means 'I', which Max combines with 'want'.",
      "gap": 0.4
